input arrays reversed: sec 12.6: a key of the old lineage that is not the honest key is a candidate's author by a succession anchored before the honest one, its handing off being anchored in the same second as that succession and so not earlier; zikaron/1 reads that old segment as its own fault (a key that handed off under zikaron/1 signing at a later position, a hard AUTHORITY_MISMATCH) and the forged genesis wins the cut; the honest succession lands in the new segment MALFORMED.
